WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
What is 3x² when x is 2?

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.600
Is it 36?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.410
No.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.290
Square first: 2² is 4.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.950
Then × 3.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:10.980
12.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.016
Powers come before multiplying.
